The `ldap-scim-bridge` Helm chart is no longer published from wire-server. It now lives in [wireapp/ldap-scim-bridge](https://github.com/wireapp/ldap-scim-bridge/tree/dev/charts/ldap-scim-bridge) and is released with an independant version (6.0.0 onwards) at `oci://quay.io/wire/charts/stable/ldap-scim-bridge`. The 5.x charts already published stay available. The `openldap` test chart moved to `examples/openldap` in the same repository.
